# Main-only git (mandatory)

## Default

- All product work lands on **`main`**.
- Do **not** create `feature/*`, `fix/*`, `chore/*`, `backup/*`, or `docs/*` branches unless the user explicitly asks for a named side branch.
- Do **not** open a GitHub PR (`gh pr create`) unless the user explicitly says PR / افتح PR.
- Do **not** treat «كومت» or «ارفع» as permission to open a PR or create a side branch.

## Separate asks only

| User said | Do | Do not |
|---|---|---|
| كومت / commit | `git commit` on current branch (normally `main`) | push, PR, new branch |
| ارفع / push | `git push` current branch | open a PR |
| PR / افتح PR | open PR only then | invent merge |
| ادمج / على main | merge/land on `main` as asked | invent a PR first |

## Remote hygiene

- Keep remote heads at **`origin/main`** unless the user asked to keep another branch.
- Do not recreate deleted side branches «for cleanliness» or «best practice».
